# One-off local scripts. These get written against the live relay with the
# admin key pasted in, so they must never reach the repo - see CLAUDE.md on
# where credentials go. Anything reusable belongs in server/scripts/ with the
# key read from the environment.
/*.mjs
/*.cjs
